title: Enter_Office
---
<<declare $entered_office = false>>
<<if $entered_office == false>>
	<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe">>
	Ashe: ... Probably time for me to go in.
	ring-ring...ring-ring
	Ashe: What? ... Dad? 
	<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe" "Teddy">>
	<<show_character_expression CharacterManager "Teddy" "angry">>
	Teddy: Ashe! Where are you? You're not in danger are you? 
	<<show_character_expression CharacterManager "Ashe" "angry">>
	Ashe: I'm fine! I'm just ... out somewhere.  
	Teddy: Ashe, I know you can be reckless, but please don't do anything to put yourself in harm's way.
	<<show_character_expression CharacterManager "Teddy" "sad">>
	Teddy: There are people out there who can hurt you. I ... want you to be safe.
	<<show_character_expression CharacterManager "Ashe" "sad">>
	Ashe: I'll be fine Dad. I'll be back for dinner.
	Teddy: ... Alright. Stay safe. 
	<<end_character_conv CharacterManager>>
	<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe">>
	Ashe: ... 
	<<end_character_conv CharacterManager>>
	<<set $entered_office = true>>
<<else>>
	<<goto_room GameManager "Ground">>
	<<if $entered_office_inside == false>>
		<<wait 2>>
		<<play_dialogue_delay DialogueManager "Inside_Office">>
	<<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

